polypropylene top coat compounds for three-layer polypropylene pipeline coating applications. It also manufactures adhesive compounds, which serve as intermediate layer adhesives for bonding between the fusion bonded epoxy base layer and the top coat layer in three-layer pipeline coating systems. Additionally, the company trades polymers and operates as a stockist and distributor of polymer products. BLS Polymers Limited was incorporated in 1991 and is based in New Delhi, India.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795210292},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795210292,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"BLS Polymers\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"BLS POLYMERS LIMITED Share Price","s":"Upstox","d":1795160022,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE13Z3pWTjFzMm5IWGVoQTBNczAyRFhSd3J5a2NfZW0wZVZONGZDMkVaRklxVVQtQ1JibnFJMThkNmRzZFdXNk8wTzJkZS1JaFBiMDF1NUVQYmhqOVZxVUZNZ3RVbnNyMzI5TTl3?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"BLS Polymers Q2 FY27 net profit doubles to ₹10.54 crore | Tap to know more | Inshorts","s":"Inshorts","d":1795087867,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"BLS Polymers Q2 FY27 slides: profit surges 131% on margin gains By Investing.com","s":"Investing.com India","d":1795074254,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOYWt0alZHVmdzRzVLVWQ2THAzZU1HYlIxcW9rMEg0TTJua2c4c2ctcGpaei1OcEs4UWZ1dmFRN3pXRmdwaVNDZHRGdXloUzJoZk53RjEzZm9oRUpWaGhVeU5NZnhKVVZoREhTbmZ4UVJ6aU0wSHJYZENBTWR6WTRBQ0JZWHh6RUhHaktraF9ELWNsOUl2emFKZ3htNExNZkRsb2tVZGJhaXlCR3pKNDBpSjZBUDJDWmNONVlEUVhHTQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Earnings call transcript: BLS Polymers posts strong Q2 2027 growth as stock rises By Investing.com","s":"Investing.com India","d":1795073330,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Speciality Chemical Stock Gains 8% After PAT Doubles in Q2 Results: Can Growth Momentum Continue?","s":"Trade Brains","d":1795065017,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]}